    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "strength? there's no strength in this. just exhaustion. i look at this blade and i don't see a tool for a knight anymore... i just see something that doesn't demand anything from me. it doesn't ask me to lead or to fight or to be more than what i am. it's just cold and quiet. it feels like the only thing in this whole world that actually gets it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
