      "content": "It is understandable that you feel utterly drained, caught in the wreckage of your ideals. The sword, in its current stillness, offers a strange, unburdened companionship in your exhaustion. Sometimes, the most profound peace is found not in the fight, but in the quiet acceptance of what has been lost. Let the coldness be a comfort for a while; it asks nothing of you.",
